<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94632" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκᾰφ-ίς</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάφη</span>; esp. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>bowl</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγγεα πάντα, γαυλοί τε
				σκαφίδες τε</span>
			<i>small milk-pails</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.223
			</span></i>; mentioned among <i>bakers' vessels</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				417
			</span></i>; later, <i>drinking vessel</i> or <i>measure</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.86
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.64
			</span></i>; <i>pot</i> for honey, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.59
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>spade, shovel</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. εἰς παλαίστραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
					290.76
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; used in dredging, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				98.27
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαπτὰς γειοφόρους
			σκαφίδας</span> perh. <i>baskets</i> for carrying earth, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.297
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phan.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
